%%%%Denote by $\OO^{min}(G)$ be the smallest subalgebra of $\OO(G)$ that contains functions $\OO^i_j,\bar\OO^i_j, i,j\in\{1,\ldots,n\}$ from Proposition \ref{prop:O}.
