In \Cref{Exp_Uniform_k}, we assume that $\mathbf{x}$ follows a uniform distribution. Similar to \Cref{Exp_PowerPositive} in \Cref{Sec_2D_OptMech}, when $1/2\leq k<1$,
\begin{equation*}
