\section*{Discussion}
% The Discussion should be succinct and must not contain subheadings.

% 我们的研究结果为人工智能和生物智能系统之间的趋同进化提供了令人信服的证据。尽管起源, 架构和学习机制存在根本差异，但人工智能模型会自发地开发出与人类大脑活动模式逐步一致的表征，以优化任务性能。这种新兴的一致性发生在没有明确的神经生物学约束的情况下，这表明某些计算解决方案可能适用于智能信息处理，超越特定的物理实现~\cite{hasson2020direct, richards2019deep, zador2019critique}。
Our findings provide compelling evidence for convergent evolution between artificial and biological intelligence systems. Despite fundamentally different origins, architectures, and learning mechanisms, AI models spontaneously develop representations that progressively align with human brain activity patterns as they optimize for task performance. This emergent alignment occurs without explicit neurobiological constraints, suggesting that certain computational solutions may be universal for intelligent information processing, transcending specific physical implementations~\cite{hasson2020direct, richards2019deep, zador2019critique}.

% \paragraph{性能-一致性关系和趋同进化} 在语言和视觉领域，模型性能与大脑一致性之间的稳健相关性或许是趋同进化最引人注目的证据。在两种模态中观察到的对数关系表明收益递减的原则轨迹，其中最初的改进会产生显着的一致性收益，然后是更适度的增加。这种模式与理论观点相一致，表明当复杂系统接近信息处理挑战的最佳解决方案时，尽管进化途径不同，它们也会自然地向相似的计算策略收敛~\cite{yamins2014performance, marblestone2016toward}。与视觉模型相比，语言模型中观察到的相关性明显更强（r=0.89$ vs. $r=0.56$），这表明语言处理可能会施加更严格的计算约束，从而将解决方案引向类似大脑的实现~\cite{schrimpf2021neural, caucheteux2022brains}。与视觉感知相比，这种模态差异可能反映了语言对抽象和语境整合的要求更高~\cite{fedorenko2014reworking, pereira2018toward}。
\paragraph{Performance Alignment and Convergent Evolution} The robust correlation between model performance and brain alignment across both language and vision domains represents perhaps the most striking evidence for convergent evolution. The logarithmic relationship observed in both modalities suggests a principled trajectory of diminishing returns, where initial improvements yield substantial alignment gains followed by more modest increases. This pattern aligns with theoretical perspectives suggesting that as complex systems approach optimal solutions for information processing challenges, they naturally converge toward similar computational strategies despite different evolutionary pathways~\cite{yamins2014performance, marblestone2016toward}. The substantially stronger correlation observed in language models compared to vision models ($r=0.89$ vs. $r=0.53$) suggests that language processing may impose more stringent computational constraints that channel solutions toward brain-like implementations~\cite{schrimpf2021neural, caucheteux2022brains}. This modality difference may reflect the heightened abstraction and contextual integration demands of language compared to visual perception~\cite{fedorenko2014reworking, pereira2018toward}.

% \paragraph{分层表征组织} 分层分析揭示了不同的表征轨迹，这些轨迹概括了大脑处理层次的各个方面。视觉模型显示，随着深度的增加，对齐逐渐增加，反映了视觉皮层从具体特征检测到抽象物体识别的层次结构~\cite{yamins2016using, cichy2016comparison}。相比之下，语言模型表现出更高的整体对齐和更分散的模式，与更高层次认知整合相关的边缘, 默认模式和额顶叶网络的对应性最强~\cite{goldstein2022shared, dobs2022brain}。这表明语言模型直接与更抽象, 更集成的表征进行交互，类似于更高层次的认知网络中的表征。更深层次的视觉模型层开始与语言处理共享表征属性的观察结果与具身认知理论相一致，表明视觉和语言系统在更高层次的语义处理中融合~\cite{binder2016toward, huth2016natural}。
% \paragraph{Hierarchical Representational Organization} Layer-wise analysis revealed distinct representational trajectories that recapitulate aspects of the brain's processing hierarchy. Vision models show progressive alignment increases with depth, mirroring the hierarchical organization of the visual cortex from concrete feature detection to abstract object recognition~\cite{yamins2016using, cichy2016comparison}. In contrast, language models exhibit higher overall alignment and a more distributed pattern, with strongest correspondence to limbic, default mode, and frontoparietal networks associated with higher-level cognitive integration~\cite{goldstein2022shared, dobs2022brain}. This suggests language models directly engage with more abstract, integrated representations similar to those in higher cognitive networks. The observation that deeper vision model layers begin to share representational properties with language processing aligns with theories of embodied cognition suggesting visual and language systems converge in higher-level semantic processing~\cite{binder2016toward, huth2016natural}.

\paragraph{Hierarchical and Multi-scale Organization} Layer-wise and multi-scale alignment analyses revealed systematic gradients of representational organization. Vision models show a gradual increase in brain alignment with depth, paralleling the hierarchical progression from low-level to high-level visual processing in the brain~\cite{yamins2016using, cichy2016comparison}. Language models exhibit stronger and more distributed alignment, corresponding to association areas involved in abstract semantic processing~\cite{goldstein2022shared, dobs2022brain}. Importantly, deeper vision model layers begin to resemble language models, suggesting cross-modal convergence at higher abstraction levels~\cite{binder2016toward, huth2016natural}. Multi-scale analysis further revealed a posterior-to-anterior shift in alignment across brain regions, consistent with a transition from localized, feature-specific representations to distributed, integrative ones~\cite{margulies2016situating, huntenburg2018large}. The stronger modulation in language models supports the notion that language operates on inherently broader representational scales~\cite{fedorenko2016language, hagoort2019neurobiology}.

% 纵向分析表明，大脑对齐始终先于任务绩效的提升，这表明类脑表征可能作为计算的垫脚石，而不仅仅是训练的副产品~\cite{saxe2019mathematical, kriegeskorte2015deep}。这种现象在不同的​​架构和规模上均有观察到，这强化了以下观点：随着模型性能优化，趋同进化将会出现。分类聚类进一步表明，架构归纳偏差强烈地塑造了对齐轮廓。CNN 和 Transformer 形成了不同的聚类，而混合模型则呈现出连续的轮廓。在我们的分析中，具有残差连接和注意力机制的模型表现出更高的大脑对齐得分，这表明这些架构元素可能促进表征结构更接近生物系统~\cite{kriegeskorte2018cognitive, kietzmann2019recurrence, kubilius2019brain}。
\paragraph{Temporal Dynamics and Architectural Inductive Biases}
Longitudinal analysis revealed that brain alignment consistently precedes improvements in task performance, suggesting that brain-like representations may function as computational stepping stones rather than mere by-products of training~\cite{saxe2019mathematical, kriegeskorte2015deep}. This phenomenon was observed across architectures and scales, reinforcing the idea that convergent evolution arises as models optimize for performance. Taxonomic clustering further showed that architectural inductive biases strongly shape alignment profiles. CNNs and transformers formed distinct clusters, while hybrid models exhibited a continuum of profiles. Models with residual connections and attention mechanisms exhibited higher brain alignment scores in our analysis, suggesting these architectural elements may promote representational structures that more closely resemble biological systems~\cite{kriegeskorte2018cognitive, kietzmann2019recurrence, kubilius2019brain}.


% 我们的多尺度对齐分析进一步揭示了随着核大小的增加，后部感觉区域向前部关联区域的系统性转变，反映了从局部, 特征特定处理到更分散, 上下文相关表示的梯度。这与神经科学对皮质组织的既定理解一致~\cite{margulies2016situating, huntenburg2018large}，其中较早的感觉区域处理具体特征，而较高的关联区域则在更广泛的概念尺度上整合信息。这种模式在受试者之间的一致性表明了大脑信息处理中的一个基本组织原则，人工系统可能会重现~\cite{mcintosh2000towards, mesulam1998sensation}。在语言模型中观察到的更强的调制进一步支持了以下假设：语言处理本质上比视觉处理在更大的表征尺度上运行~\cite{fedorenko2016language, hagoort2019neurobiology}。
