% \paragraph{局限性与影响} 一些局限性值得关注。首先，我们的分析依赖于时间分辨率有限的静态 fMRI 数据，这可能会掩盖神经处理中细粒度的时间动态。未来结合脑电图 (EEG) 或脑磁图 (MEG) 的研究可以为时间处理的一致性提供补充性见解~\cite{cichy2016comparison, mante2013context}。其次，NSD 数据集虽然内容广泛，但主要捕捉的是大脑对被动观看视觉刺激的反应，而非复杂的认知任务或丰富的语言内容。这一局限性限制了我们全面评估与高阶认知功能（尤其是在联想皮层和执行网络中）的一致性的能力，并且可能使我们的语言模型一致性分析偏向视觉语义，而非更广泛的语言处理~\cite{allen2022massive}。未来的研究将受益于结合能够捕捉复杂推理、问题解决和抽象思维任务期间神经活动的数据集。第三，尽管我们采用了标准基准来衡量模型性能，但由于潜在的数据污染问题，这些指标可能无法完美地反映模型能力，因为测试数据可能被包含在训练数据中~\cite{dodge2021documenting, brown2020language}。这种污染问题对于在可能包含基准示例或类似内容的海量互联网语料库上训练的大型语言模型尤其重要，这可能会导致对模型真实能力的估计过高~\cite{bender2021dangers, carlini2022quantifying}。


\paragraph{Limitations and Implications}
Our study has several limitations. First, we rely on static fMRI data with limited temporal resolution, which may overlook fine-grained dynamics. Second, the NSD dataset centers on passive visual processing, limiting insight into language-specific or abstract reasoning processes. Third, benchmark contamination may inflate performance estimates for large models trained on internet-scale corpora~\cite{dodge2021documenting, bender2021dangers}. Future studies could integrate richer behavioral datasets and temporally resolved neural recordings to address these issues.

These findings have broad implications. For neuroscience, they suggest that AI models optimized for general tasks may spontaneously recapitulate brain-like representations, supporting the idea that cortical organization reflects efficient computational solutions~\cite{kriegeskorte2019interpreting, richards2019deep}. For AI, they imply that brain-aligned architectures or objectives could guide model development and improve interpretability~\cite{hassabis2017neuroscience, lindsay2021convolutional}. Ultimately, understanding how and why alignment emerges may bridge the gap between natural and artificial intelligence.


