\item the union of two compatible partitions is defined as $\sigma=\sigma_1\vert\ldots\vert\sigma_{d}$ when for each $r$, with $1\leq r\leq d$, there exist $i$ and $j$ such that $\sigma_r=\delta_i=\tau_j$ or $\sigma_r=\delta_i\subset \tau_j$ or $\sigma_r=\tau_j\subset\delta_i$.
