        \colorbox{cyan!10}{\texttt{Other}} types of intents include a reference to prior work in a scientific paper that provides background or context without emphasizing the impact, significance, or influence of the cited work. It acknowledges the source in a routine or supporting role rather than showcasing its importance to the research.\\
